<title>CHINA: HK&amp;Shanghai Hotels interim net up 8 pct.</title>
<headline>HK&amp;Shanghai Hotels interim net up 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   35    vs 35</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    15.0  vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    412   vs 380</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,433 vs 1,272</p>
<p>    Company name		 Hongkong and Shanghai Hotels Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 8-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Hongkong and Shanghai Hotels owns and manages hotels. It also engages in airline catering, food retailing, club and restaurant management, property development and investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
